  "schema:name": "NHWA Module 4: Working conditions, governance and leadership",
  "schema:description": "\"This module addresses working conditions, governance and leadership from various perspectives: health workers, national leadership capacity, and contribution of the country to regional and global mandates.\" Indicators 4-01 to 4-05. Their data sources do not include the registry. Term module-4 in the nhwa-2023 glossary (litlfred/who-iris glossary/nhwa-2023.glossary.json), from National health workforce accounts: a handbook, 2nd ed. (WHO 2023, ISBN 9789240081291).",
